{"parse": {"title": "DAU-02", "pageid": 40838, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/DAU-01\" title=\"DAU-01\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">DAU-02</span><a href=\"/wiki/DAU-03\" title=\"DAU-03\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">DAU</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">02</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E5.9C.A8.E5.B2.B8.E8.BE.B9\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"在岸边\">在岸边</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 在岸边</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">On the Shore</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 1860102</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_8_bg_zhigongshitang.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_8_bg_zhigongshitang\"><img alt=\"1_8_bg_zhigongshitang\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d7/Cg-1_8_bg_zhigongshitang.png/600px-Cg-1_8_bg_zhigongshitang.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d7/Cg-1_8_bg_zhigongshitang.png/900px-Cg-1_8_bg_zhigongshitang.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d7/Cg-1_8_bg_zhigongshitang.png/1200px-Cg-1_8_bg_zhigongshitang.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>削减公共开支之后的食堂人影寥落，一大一小两人在座位之间穿行。他们一次一次摸过那些桌布，确认整洁。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这本不是维拉通常负责的内容，更不是小孩子肩负的责任，只是此刻更多的人们都聚集到广场上的举手之劳。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>片刻过后，一场讲座就会在那里展开。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿夫西维：</div><div>♪～♬～</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>“一艘摇摇欲坠的新船”……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>喃喃自语间，维拉将最后一个靠窗座位上的桌布褶皱抹平。这似乎宣告着一个阶段的结束，因此她松出一口气，微笑起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>好了。我们可以去广场了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿夫西维：</div><div>摇晃的新船～我们要坐着它出发，去广场～</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿夫西维：</div><div>北方哨歌也在！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿夫西维：</div><div>但是，我们安抚好桌椅同志了吗？他们知道罐头同志很快就会到来，坐在他们身边，好长出更多罐头来……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>呵呵～是的，小阿夫西维。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>只要我们跟布林饼同志道别，然后确认这些桌椅同志们，都好好待在他们的位置上，就没有任何问题。因为——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>——因为——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>余下的话变得难以吐露，像因为窒息，也像被外力陡然扼住了咽喉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>呃……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>不妙预感攀升至头皮的速度比手臂上鳞片的震颤更快，抬起头，维拉下意识向窗外投去一瞥。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她的“同胞”找到她了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>咳——咳咳！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿夫西维：</div><div>维拉？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>阿夫西维……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>我需要你现在去叫上你的同学们，去找到叶甫根尼同志，和他呆在一起。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>你知道他在哪里，对吧？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿夫西维：</div><div>我知道！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>那就快出发吧，阿夫西维同志。这是一个……只属于你的任务。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_8_bg_xiaozhengangkou2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_8_bg_xiaozhengangkou2\"><img alt=\"1_8_bg_xiaozhengangkou2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/74/Cg-1_8_bg_xiaozhengangkou2.png/600px-Cg-1_8_bg_xiaozhengangkou2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/74/Cg-1_8_bg_xiaozhengangkou2.png/900px-Cg-1_8_bg_xiaozhengangkou2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/74/Cg-1_8_bg_xiaozhengangkou2.png/1200px-Cg-1_8_bg_xiaozhengangkou2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在码头的卸货区，围绕着驳船安全区的水域，有一个偏离了小镇中线，因此不被察觉的盲点，维拉知道。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在来亚什基极少出现的的温暖天气里，除了游泳馆之外，这儿原本是她最常去到的地方。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>萨莫蒂瓦。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一连串旋律裹挟着怪异的音节很快被当作回应抛出，就像被奇肯恩扔上码头的水藻，掷地有声，滞重而潮湿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一位不速之客。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"624601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-624601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-624601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"624601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-624601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-624601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-624601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-624601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">萨莫蒂瓦：</div><div><i>维拉。</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"624601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-624601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-624601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"624601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-624601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-624601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-624601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-624601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">萨莫蒂瓦：</div><div><i>什么时候我们已经可以从问候开始对话了？提醒我一下。</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>你不该来这里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"624601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-624601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-624601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"624601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-624601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-624601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-624601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-624601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">萨莫蒂瓦：</div><div><i>而你这杂种不该试图教我做任何事。</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"624601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-624601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-624601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"624601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-624601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-624601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-624601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-624601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">萨莫蒂瓦：</div><div><i>你逃走之后，从不在任何地方久留……不在我们被驱逐的起点，也不在那个肮脏的内陆港口……</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"624601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-624601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-624601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"624601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-624601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-624601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-624601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-624601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">萨莫蒂瓦：</div><div><i>我还以为你最终去了一个怎样令人流连忘返的地方，可结果……看看这里。</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"624601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-624601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-624601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"624601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-624601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-624601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-624601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-624601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">萨莫蒂瓦：</div><div><i>哈，一个硕大的植物坟场。无鳞鬼围绕着尸体载歌载舞，甚至在上面建起“家园”。</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"624601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-624601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-624601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"624601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-624601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-624601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-624601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-624601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">萨莫蒂瓦：</div><div><i>这倒是不错，和我们一样。</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>可以说维拉对这天其实早有预见。纯血同族对清除“不洁”的偏执，就像荒野里遍生的苔藓，反复生长，除之不尽。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>如果没有人站出来，仇恨将永远循环下去。我已经告诉过你了，萨莫蒂瓦。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>这恨也蒙蔽了你的双眼，所以你才看不见……看不见我和他们能描绘的一切。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>你只能看见你想要看到的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"624601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-624601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-624601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"624601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-624601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-624601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-624601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-624601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">萨莫蒂瓦：</div><div><i>那很重要吗？无论如何，这次我不会再给你选择了。</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"624601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-624601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-624601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"624601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-624601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-624601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-624601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-624601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">萨莫蒂瓦：</div><div><i>你只能死。</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307720.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/HeadIconSmall-307720.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307720.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307720.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/HeadIconSmall-307720.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307720.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/HeadIconSmall-307720.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307720.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>——维拉——维拉女士——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307720.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/HeadIconSmall-307720.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307720.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307720.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/HeadIconSmall-307720.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307720.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/HeadIconSmall-307720.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307720.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>我的讲座马上就要开始了，我想请你帮个忙——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这声音立刻将两位人鱼与水中举起的锋利水箭一起钉在了原地。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307720.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/HeadIconSmall-307720.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307720.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307720.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/HeadIconSmall-307720.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307720.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/HeadIconSmall-307720.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307720.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>……哦，等等，我的资料……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>维拉几乎是惊恐地注意到，面前同族金色的眼睛饶有趣味地眯起了。那些由水塑型而成的箭矢也随主人视线调转方位，不再对着自己，而是朝向先前声音的来源。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>——朝着半路停下，正适合作为标靶的北方哨歌。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>该死，在哪儿呢……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308714.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0a/HeadIconSmall-308714.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308714.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308714.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0a/HeadIconSmall-308714.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308714.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0a/HeadIconSmall-308714.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308714.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>不——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>维拉从不知道自己的喉咙里能发出这样的声音。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一种细微的，但异常愤怒的声响。而后，她甚至开始使用并不娴熟、如同歌谣一般的古老语言发出警告。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>从萨莫蒂瓦身后出现的水刃并不如前者的武器锋利，它们看上去甚至相当柔软，难以成型。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_8_bg_xiaozhengangkou2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_8_bg_xiaozhengangkou2\"><img alt=\"1_8_bg_xiaozhengangkou2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/74/Cg-1_8_bg_xiaozhengangkou2.png/600px-Cg-1_8_bg_xiaozhengangkou2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/74/Cg-1_8_bg_xiaozhengangkou2.png/900px-Cg-1_8_bg_xiaozhengangkou2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/74/Cg-1_8_bg_xiaozhengangkou2.png/1200px-Cg-1_8_bg_xiaozhengangkou2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div><i>不。你不能这样做。</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>尽管如此，在萨莫蒂瓦缺少鳞片保护的脖颈处，一道青色的血痕也已经留下了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"624601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-624601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-624601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"624601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-624601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-624601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-624601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-624601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">萨莫蒂瓦：</div><div><i>……什么？</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div><i>你不能夺走她的生命，因为这里所有的生命都属于我，连同灵魂一起。</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div><i>如果你坚持如此……就算我杀不死你，我也会让你在余下的百年里都只能靠舔舐伤口过活。</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"624601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-624601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-624601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"624601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-624601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-624601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-624601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-624601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">萨莫蒂瓦：</div><div><i>你说什么？你这该死的杂种——</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div><i>你该离开这里了，萨莫蒂瓦。</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div><i>不要让我重复第三次。</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>话音落下，维拉的呼吸也凝滞了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>以往逃亡时比这还要无助的情况数不胜数，却从没有哪一次让她如此期望自己的装腔作势能够尽快奏效。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"624601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-624601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-624601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"624601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-624601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-624601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-624601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-624601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">萨莫蒂瓦：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>漫长的沉默对峙，又或许只是极其短暂的微秒之后，箭矢破开，应声入水。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>即使如此，维拉也一刻都不敢放松，因为纯血的鲁萨尔卡仍然呲着那双獠牙。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"624601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-624601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-624601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"624601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-624601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-624601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-624601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-624601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">萨莫蒂瓦：</div><div><i>……当我以为，你不会比当一个叛徒更可笑的时候，你总是能出乎我的意料。</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"624601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-624601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-624601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"624601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-624601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-624601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-624601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-624601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">萨莫蒂瓦：</div><div><i>叛离、出逃、抗拒追杀。结果事到如今……你居然告诉我，你在追求“永恒的灵魂”。</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"624601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-624601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-624601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"624601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-624601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-624601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-624601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-624601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">萨莫蒂瓦：</div><div><i>你想回家，却选了一条不可能的路。</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"624601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-624601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-624601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"624601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-624601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-624601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-624601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-624601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">萨莫蒂瓦：</div><div><i>荒谬至极。</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>事实就是这样。你也不知道那是否存在，不是吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"624601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-624601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-624601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"624601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-624601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-624601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-624601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-624601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">萨莫蒂瓦：</div><div><i>但你甚至不是个纯血种。</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"624601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-624601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-624601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"624601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-624601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-624601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-624601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-624601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">萨莫蒂瓦：</div><div><i>就算你把这整个地方的无鳞鬼都推进海里，管他们叫“落水者”，然后与他们签下契约——</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"624601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-624601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-624601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"624601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-624601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-624601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-624601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-624601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">萨莫蒂瓦：</div><div><i>你也找不到那东西。你到达不了亚特兰蒂斯。</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>你知道，我总是勇于尝试。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"624601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-624601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-624601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"624601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-624601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-624601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-624601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-624601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">萨莫蒂瓦：</div><div><i>……呵。</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"624601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-624601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-624601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"624601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-624601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-624601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-624601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-624601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">萨莫蒂瓦：</div><div><i>那么，你最好从那个喊着你的名字的脏东西开始。</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>维拉飞快回过头去，想要阻止北方哨歌继续前进。身后，裤装女人正怀抱着仪器和资料快步走来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>——维拉女士！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>在这儿做什么呢？我翻阅了咱们以前的讲座报告，按照习惯安排了这次的内容和讲解顺序，但可能还需要你的帮助来取舍一下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>因为现在的篇幅可能有些太长了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>……嗯？维拉女士？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她似乎全然没有注意到自己身后的情况。也许海面一片平静，丝毫没有他人来过的痕迹。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"624620.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/HeadIconSmall-624620.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-624620.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"624620.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/HeadIconSmall-624620.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-624620.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/HeadIconSmall-624620.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-624620.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">萨莫蒂瓦：</div><div><i>……下次……我要看到成果……</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"624620.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/HeadIconSmall-624620.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-624620.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"624620.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/HeadIconSmall-624620.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-624620.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/HeadIconSmall-624620.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-624620.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">萨莫蒂瓦：</div><div><i>否则——</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>即使维拉一直留意着动静，手臂的鳞片也警觉地竖起——她还是没能察觉萨莫蒂瓦离开的时机。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>只有湿冷的话语落下，维拉来不及做出任何回应。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>噢，如果你有什么不满意的地方，我们可以——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>不……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>不，没有，这并不针对你，北方哨歌同志。我只是有些走神。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>关于你的问题，我想我们可以边走边聊。来吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>大家应该都已经在广场上等着了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>哦，哦！是的，没错。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>是这样的，为了方便入门，我在讲稿中把理线学讲座内容分为了四个板块。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>概述和原理阐释都没有问题。需要您来帮忙取舍和简化的，多数都在引言部分……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>交谈间，两人朝着小镇的中心走去，逐渐远离了码头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>被留在她们身后的某块海面仍然轻轻地泛着水波。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "DAU-02"}}